---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<section class="relative border-b-2 border-[var(--color-ink)]">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-5 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="flex justify-between label">
      <span>Vol. 01 · {year}</span>
      <span>Buenos Aires</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display-1 mt-8 md:mt-12">
      Velas <em class="italic text-[var(--color-blue)]">+</em><br />
      <span class="wavy-underline">resina</span>.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-[44ch] text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Objetos hechos a mano, en ediciones chicas. Velas de soja, accesorios de resina,
      piezas únicas pensadas y vertidas en Buenos Aires.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/shop"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-blue)] text-[var(--color-cream)] px-6 py-3 font-semibold tracking-wide hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
      >Ver tienda →</a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex gap-2">
        <span class="block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-pink)]"></span>
        <span class="block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-blue)]"></span>
        <span class="block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-blush)]"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
